<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>Payment Failed</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .container {
        width: 80%;
        margin: 20px auto;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #f4f4f4;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .content {
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .error-box {
        background-color: #fff5f5;
        border: 1px solid #feb2b2;
        color: #c53030;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 40px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #777;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .button {
        background-color: #e53e3e;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        display: inline-block;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>Payment Unsuccessful</h1>
        <p>Order ID: #{{orderId}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
        <p>We're sorry, but we were unable to process the payment for your
          order. Your items are still reserved for a limited time, so you can
          try again using the link below.</p>

        <div class='error-box'>
          <strong>Reason for failure:</strong>
          {{failureReason}}
        </div>

        <div style='text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;'>
          <a href='{{retryUrl}}' class='button'>Retry Payment</a>
        </div>

        <p>If you continue to have issues, please check with your bank or try a
          different payment method.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Youshop. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, reply to this email or contact support.</p>
        <p style='margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10px;'>
          You received this email because you attempted a purchase at Youshop.
          <a href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'>Unsubscribe</a>
          |
          <a href='{{preferencesUrl}}'>Manage Preferences</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>